{"kind":"report","text":"Approved: exact-next pass for archive rows without published anchors. Head a3f7332b0933952d7a41634706732cd0ac09429e, tree f7733877a8aec2a9dabbb224f7f4908635c89b9c, branch builder/archive-unpublished-next-20261025: five commits on Main 86204d44, 7 paths, all named by the artifacts. Review request 6ce32f0d, checker promise d42c28db, request 3e01b385 (builder promise bc394fd5; parent 1aedd35b).\n\nRead order: the primary note at the head in full; request 3e01b385 and the planner's question 89538bb9; the diff of archive-driver.ts, archive-adaptive.ts and archive-build.ts; the witness in archive-parent-bootstrap.test.ts; the control commit 3b1e043a; the seal change; then the surrounding code at the head: the driver's planning branch (pending, conversion, capacity), planLegacyArchiveAnchors, the shared fixed finish, and buildOwnedPass's use of legacyAnchors.\n\nEvidence manifest (PD-2, ruling fcab078d). The manifest at notes/implementation/evidence/2026-10-25-archive-unpublished-next.manifest.json has sha256 854b127a141e7e1deb8924a40a6a023d46467045b9689da3880b4a74c736151b, as the request states. It names the directory /private/tmp/artroom-archive-unpublished-next-review-evidence-20261025-v1, checkpoint c26006bc / 4000f86d, and 105 files. I checked all 105: each exists with its size and sha256. Every file is read-only, and the directory is mode 0500. All 106 lines of SHA256SUMS verify. The note cites 10 distinct output digests, and all 10 are in the manifest. The /private/tmp location is the one-head exception allowed in dc3f2309 and fcab078d; later heads use ~/play/artroom-evidence/.\n\nHead and gate. The commits after the code are: c26006bc changes only the two seal literals and the note after the failed gate; a3f7332b adds only the note and the manifest. The ordinary gate 27755 at 7ebb6fb9 / c44eaf3b failed in one test file: scripts/security-entry-points.test.mjs reported \"Review changed archive authority owner: packages/scope/src/archive-build